1130022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No pressure. Art and Game are for joy and fun-if it starts turning into a slog, take a break! No reason to beat yourself up.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ditto. Please don't worry about it Boston. Take whatever time you need. Rest, relax and do what you have too. I hope you are alright.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-17T12:30:12-07:00","id":1325357,"title":"","content":"I really loved and miss this quest. I dont need the author to restart it, but i wanted to say this has been one of the cooler quests i've read here and really loved the ops world and story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8897-joshopotamus","name":"joshopotamus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}